# Infrastructure Layer

Outermost layer of the Onion. Persistence adapters, web controllers,
and external integrations — the "how".

Rules:
- Web routers in `infrastructure/web/<module>_router.py` — DRF views
  and URL patterns.
- Persistence adapters in `infrastructure/persistence/<module>_repository.py`
  implement the domain repository interface against Django ORM models.
- Infrastructure may import from `domain/`, `application/`, `core/`,
  and `config/`.

Files per bounded context:
- `web/<module>_router.py` — DRF views + URL patterns
- `persistence/<module>_repository.py` — Django ORM persistence adapter
  implementing the domain interface
